OL,3,GNEWSAHow do you keep soil healthy
OL,4,Aduring a drought?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has been a summer of record-breaking
OL,7,Ftemperatures, heatwaves, drought and
OL,8,Fhosepipe bans, leaving many farmers and
OL,9,Fgrowers struggling.
OL,11,FBut one grower near St Columb,
OL,12,FCornwall, who operates a small-scale
OL,13,Fmarket garden, has been relatively
OL,14,Funaffected by the drought, he has said.
OL,16,FConor Kendrew has set up an irrigation
OL,17,Fsystem that uses a spring, a pond and
OL,18,Fany collected rain water and, because
OL,19,Fthe site is 0.5 acre (0.2 hectare),
OL,20,Fsprinklers can reach a large part of
OL,21,Fthe crop.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
