OL,3,GNEWSAHow do you keep soil healthy
OL,4,Aduring a drought?
OL,5,
OL,6,FKendrew said: "We invested very very
OL,7,Fheavily from the outset on a very good
OL,8,Firrigation system. We could probably
OL,9,Fpush pressure that is about six times
OL,10,Fwhat people's houses are sitting at,
OL,11,Fwhich means we can make it rain."
